@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName PingFang SC
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 65
hide footbox
title 预约单与预约记录状态图
state "ReservationSlip 预约单" as Slip {
 state "待补货\nWAITING_STOCK" as WAITING_STOCK
 state "待借出或可借阅\nREADY_TO_LEND" as READY_TO_LEND
 state "已兑现\nFULFILLED" as FULFILLED
 [*] --> WAITING_STOCK : 无可借复本 / 创建预约单
 WAITING_STOCK --> READY_TO_LEND : UC03 入库或 UC05 归还\n[轮到本单且分配复本成功]\n/ 创建 PENDING_LEND 借阅记录
 READY_TO_LEND --> FULFILLED : UC02 管理员确认对应记录借出
}
state "ReservationRecord 预约记录" as Record {
 state "未处理\nWAITING" as WAITING
 state "已处理\nHANDLED" as HANDLED
 [*] --> WAITING : 创建预约单时同时创建
 WAITING --> HANDLED : 预约单成功转 READY_TO_LEND
}
note bottom of Slip
WAITING_STOCK 不占用复本。
READY_TO_LEND 占用 RESERVED 复本。
通知失败不改变状态；FULFILLED 保留历史。
end note
note bottom of Record
HANDLED 表示已安排可借复本，
不表示读者已归还图书。
end note
@enduml
